{
  "status": "INFERRED. Read at runtime by CK3xBL.Appearance (BannerBuilder). Bannerlord icons have no names in banner_icons.xml (bridge/data/bl_banner_icons.json), so every id here except those with 'labeled' = true is a placeholder pick inside the right category (Animal 100-164, Flora 200-223, Handmade 300-347, Sign 400-463, Shape 500-535) until the icons are labelled from the in-game icon sheet (IconSheet.DumpAll). Fix ids here; no code change is needed.",
  "how_it_is_used": [
    "Layer 0: background 'plain_background' filling the canvas in CK3 color1 (team colour 1).",
    "Field divisions: the CK3 pattern texture (G = color2, B = color3) and every non-charge emblem (non_charge_regex: ordinaries, frames, field patterns) are rasterised per colour area from the user's install and approximated by up to max_division_layers rectangle_icon layers (16, 8, then 4 cells per side; a fit is accepted when |rectangles - coverage| / coverage <= division_max_error). Areas under division_min_area of the shield are decorations and are ignored; shapes that cannot be fitted (checkers, frames, roundels) are dropped.",
    "Charges: each charge emblem's texture name (without ce_ and .dds) is split at '_' and matched against 'charges[].keywords' as whole words (a trailing s/es is ignored; keywords containing '_' match as substrings); the first matching rule wins; the icon is placed with the CK3 instance position/scale/mirror/rotation (shield 0..1 -> 512 px centred at 764). Unmatched charges use 'fallback_charge'.",
    "Icon colour = the emblem's color1, or color2/color3/contrast when it would vanish into the background."
  ],
  "plain_background": 11,
  "rectangle_icon": 510,
  "rectangle_icon_note": "Shape 510 is stretched into full-width bars by stock clan banners (Modules/SandBox/ModuleData/spclans.xml, e.g. 510.19.171.1528.353.758.658), so it is taken as a plain rectangle filling its size box. INFERRED.",
  "max_division_layers": 10,
  "division_max_error": 0.25,
  "division_min_area": 0.04,
  "max_icon_layers": 32,
  "non_charge_regex": "^ce_(ordinary|per_|party|quarter|gyron|paly|pales|bendy|bends|barry|bars|barru|chequy|checky|checkers|block|border|bend|pale|fess|chevron|pile|stripes|circle$|circle_|empty|mena_(pale|fess|bend)|.*frame|.*pattern|.*stripes|.*_dual$|lozengy|lozenge|bordure|chief|saltire_|cross_.*_border|india_doted|vair|ermine|fretty|masoned|waves|wavy|diagonal|dancetty|embattled|indented|engrailed|label|(circle|crescent)_mask)",
